        <h2>Sisi’s Gamble: How Egypt's Turn Toward Iran Changes Power in The Region</h2>
        <div class="postmeta col-md-6 notprint">
          <i class="fa fa-calendar-plus-o"></i><span class="post-date"> 11 Kasım 2016, Cuma</span>          
        <i class="fa fa-user-o"></i><span class="post-users"> <a href="20,5,,15,yrd_doc_dr_ismail_numan_telci.html" title="Yrd. Doç. Dr. İsmail Numan Telci" class="important">Yrd. Doç. Dr. İsmail Numan Telci</a></span>
